# REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP Client. Swagger UI: http://localhost:3000/docs
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Buscar activos por ticker o nombre
GET {{base}}/instruments?q=pampa

### Portfolio del usuario 1 (seed)
GET {{base}}/users/1/portfolio

### Ingreso de pesos (CASH_IN sobre el instrumento ARS, id 66)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 66, "side": "CASH_IN", "type": "MARKET", "size": 100000 }

### Compra MARKET por cantidad: se ejecuta al último close → FILLED
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### Compra MARKET por monto en pesos: máximo de acciones enteras → FILLED
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": "10000" }

### Compra LIMIT → NEW (reserva los pesos hasta ejecutarse o cancelarse)
# @name limitOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 10, "price": "900.50" }

### Cancelar la orden LIMIT anterior (solo NEW → CANCELLED)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{limitOrder.response.body.id}}/cancel

### Venta por más acciones de las disponibles → REJECTED (queda guardada)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 100000 }

### Reintento idempotente: misma key → 200 con la orden original, sin duplicar
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-retry-demo

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### Error de validación → 400 application/problem+json
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 1, "price": "1.005" }
